<title>USA: Sioux Falls cattle steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls cattle steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers opened fully steady with Monday's trade. Trading fairly active. Demand good by all buying interests. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers:  Load Choice predominantly 3 1375 lbs old crop 66.00. High Select and Choice 2-3 1150-1350 lbs 64.50-65.50, few 66.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers:  High Select and Choice 2-3 1025-1125 lbs 64.00-65.00.</p>
</text>
